SUMMARY:Funny Girl Deeply Discounted Tickets + Dinner (Niagara-on-the-Lake
 )
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Saturday June 27th**\, **join us in N
 iagara-on-the-Lake to see Funny Girl\, the number 1 show at the Shaw Festi
 val this year.** Two other shows will also be playing - Sleuth and Heartbr
 eak House. I will be seeing Funny Girl\, and I have 2 additional tickets s
 eated together and deeply discounted at $58 (regular $127) each available 
 for purchase by messaging me. After the show\, there will be time for shop
 ping and we will end with dinner\, prior to heading back to Toronto. **Not
 e**: **you will need to arrange your own transportation to and from\, and 
 confirm if you will be joining for dinner\, as reservations are required. 
 In addition\, all out of town events require your cell and email.**\n\n**S
 YNOPSIS**:\n***Funny Girl*** (2 hours 40 mins)\nFanny Brice has everything
  it takes to be Broadway’s next big thing: the voice\, the charm and mor
 e than a little chutzpah. But does she have “the look?” This touching 
 comedy explores her unlikely rise to stardom with the Ziegfeld Follies as 
 well as her turbulent love life with gambler Nick Arnstein. One of the gre
 atest musical scores of all time\, *Funny Girl* includes classics like “
 Don’t Rain on My Parade”\, “I’m the Greatest Star”\, “People
 ” and much more.\n\n***Sleuth*** (2 hours 20 mins)\nWhen a celebrated my
 stery writer invites his wife’s lover to their home in the English count
 ryside\, all is not as it seems. What unfolds is a fiendishly clever game 
 of psychology and deception – but who is playing with whom? And is it re
 ally just a game? This Tony and Edgar award-winning play is a quintessenti
 al crime thriller guaranteed to provide an edge-of-your-seat experience. P
 erfect for whodunit fans.\n\n***Heartbreak House*** (time unknown at posti
 ng)\nThe shadows of war may be gathering\, but for most of the weekend gue
 sts at Heartbreak House\, the big questions are about love and marriage. A
 s the couples waltz in a dance of ever-changing partners\, only the enigma
 tic old sea dog Captain Shotover seems to see what is coming towards them.
  Often ranked as one of the great plays of all time\, *Heartbreak House* i
 s Shaw at his most entertaining and mysterious.\nNote: show is currently s
 old out but people update their tickets all the time\, so you can likely s
 core a ticket.\n\n**TRANSPORTATION**:\n\n* Arrange for your own transporta
 tion. Feel free to post in the Comments if you want/need to carpool.\n* **
 Carpool attendees MUST have a picture and arrange a PUBLIC pick-up/ drop o
 ff spot for the security of members**. Any risks associated with carpoolin
 g are borne by the member\, and Experience Toronto cannot be held liable u
 nder any circumstances.\n* The Shaw Express is not running that day\n\n\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**REG
 ULAR COST**\n**[Funny Girl](https://tickets.shawfest.com/62909/63812?_ga=2
 .155224507.1689541644.1778718525-2061702442.1778718525&_gl=1*1vam915*_gcl_
 au*ODgyNTQyMzM2LjE3Nzg3MTg1MjQ.*_ga*MjA2MTcwMjQ0Mi4xNzc4NzE4NTI1*_ga_V9TSP
 2489D*czE3Nzg3MTg1MjQkbzEkZzEkdDE3Nzg3MjA0NTUkajU5JGwwJGgw)**: $51 - $208 
 + transaction fee\n\n**[Sleuth](https://tickets.shawfest.com/62940/63562?_
 gl=1*10mqovx*_gcl_au*ODgyNTQyMzM2LjE3Nzg3MTg1MjQ.*_ga*MjA2MTcwMjQ0Mi4xNzc4
 NzE4NTI1*_ga_V9TSP2489D*czE3Nzg3MTg1MjQkbzEkZzEkdDE3Nzg3MjAzMzgkajYwJGwwJG
 gw&_ga=2.142640821.1689541644.1778718525-2061702442.1778718525)**: $113 - 
 183 + transaction fee\n\n**[Heartbreak House](https://www.shawfest.com/pla
